Homepage: https://github.com/shreyaaassss/Veritas
Description: DPDPA Compliance Platform
 Veritas is an on-premise, licensed compliance monitoring platform
 for the Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023.
 Includes PII detection, breach investigation, audit logging, and a
 real-time compliance dashboard.
